Troubleshooting
Build fails with permission denied:

Ensure scripts are executable: chmod +x scripts/*.sh
Version not updating:

Check sed syntax for your system (BSD vs GNU)
Verify VERSION_FILE path in version.sh
Git tag already exists:

Delete existing tag: git tag -d v0.0.1
Or use different version bump type
Release notes empty:

Ensure commits follow conventional format (feat:, fix:)
Check git log output: git log --oneline
